<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Would you walk with the Lord in the light of His Word,</l><l>And have peace and contentment alway;</l><l>You must do His sweet will to be free from all ill;</l><l>On the altar your all you must lay.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Oh, we never can know what the Lord will bestow</l><l>Of the blessings for which we have prayed,</l><l>Till our body and soul He doth fully control,</l><l>And our all on the altar is laid.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Who can tell all the love He will send from above!</l><l>Oh, how happy our heart will be made!</l><l>Oh, what fellowship sweet we shall share at His feet,</l><l>When our all on the altar is laid!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
